      "content": "i know i should talk to them but my doctor is super hard to reach and i have a follow up in like 3 weeks... the cramps are making it hard to sleep. i looked it up and 99mg isn't even a huge dose. wouldnt a little bit of extra potassium be safe enough to just try for a few days until i can see him? it seems like such a small amount.",
